Z||000000||87 Pegasus||09-13-2001||09:46 PM||||Tomorrow is the national day of Silence at 12:00 p.m. EST.  At this time I would like to ask all of you to stop what you are doing and pray to all who have lost their lives in this trouble act of terrioism.  And to send out a THANK YOU to all of those you are putting their own lives in Harms way to help find the survioirs who are still in the WTC.  Those are the true HEROS and that is why we as AMERICANS MUST STAND TALL and help out..  WE are a UNITED country.  AND I am DAMN PROUND to be an AMERICAN.  This was a trouble act.  But as President Bush said...  "Our foundation was rocked and broken, but the Foundation of Americans can never be broken."  "We as a nation need to Stand tall and Fight for what we beleive in and that is FREEDOM."  And that will never ever be taken away from us.  We need not be scared to fly, to go into a tall building, or to step foot into a large city.  This was in a way a reality check.  We were hit hard BUT we need to step up and shake it.  We need to get the gears rolling again.  I hope we never see this again, and that the next time we see this thing again it is when we give the biggest payback of all time to those who did this.  This is all i have to say... Thank You for listening and goodnight AMERICAN where ever you are....    <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/halfpole_8.gif"> <P>------------------<BR>Friends don't let friends drive Corvettes!!||||reg||9
